      "value": "I have tested the implementation of VRSS in Boneworks and in Pavlov VR (reading multiple tutorials, trying different MSAA levels and resolutions) and reached the conclusion that it currently doesn't improve performance/visual quality on my system.\n(i5-4690k RTX2060s 16gb RAM)\nWhile, in concept, i do think it is the future of better graphics/performance in VR, the current implementation leaves a lot to be desired. In my opinion, it would be better to wait until Nvidia improves the tech to finally implement it in VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
